stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Invited: admin creates invite
  Invited --> Active: redeemed once, sign in or set password
  Invited --> Expired: link not used in time
  Active --> Expiring: expiry date near
  Expiring --> Active: admin extends
  Expiring --> Expired: date passes
  Active --> Disabled: admin disables
  Disabled --> Active: admin enables
  Expired --> [*]
  Disabled --> [*]: admin deletes
